#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:9
msgid "Interactive Demos"
msgstr "交互演示"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:11
msgid ""
"Explore physics and trained policies directly in your browser. Each card "
"opens one self-contained Newton simulation with camera controls, pause, and "
"reset. The simulation runs locally on the CPU through WebAssembly; no Isaac "
"Lab installation or remote simulation server is needed."
msgstr ""
"直接在浏览器中探索物理效果和训练好的策略。每张卡片会打开一个独立的 Newton 仿真，提供相机控制、暂停和重置功能。仿真通过 WebAssembly "
"在本地 CPU 上运行，无需安装 Isaac Lab，也无需远程仿真服务器。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:16
msgid "Open the `hosted gallery <../../../demos/v3/>`_ to browse all demos."
msgstr "打开 `在线演示库 <../../../demos/v3/>`_ 浏览全部演示。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:18
msgid ""
"These compact scenes illustrate individual effects. Use the full Isaac Lab "
"examples and tasks for evaluation, training, and measured comparisons."
msgstr "这些精简场景用于展示单项效果。评估、训练和定量比较请使用完整的 Isaac Lab 示例与任务。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:22
msgid "Solver and actuator tuning"
msgstr "求解器与执行器调参"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:27
msgid "VBD material stiffness"
msgstr "VBD 材料刚度"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:33
msgid ""
"Compare three deformable cubes. Adjust shear, volume stiffness, damping, and"
" gravity, then repeat the same drop."
msgstr "对比三个可变形立方体。调整剪切刚度、体积刚度、阻尼和重力，再重复同一次下落过程。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:36
msgid "VBD cloth bending"
msgstr "VBD 布料弯曲"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:42
msgid ""
"Compare cloth sheets draping over rollers. Change the middle sheet's bending"
" stiffness and gravity."
msgstr "对比布料垂落在滚筒上的效果，调整中间布料的弯曲刚度和重力。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:45
msgid "MJWarp sliding friction"
msgstr "MJWarp 滑动摩擦"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:51
msgid ""
"Change a box's friction on an incline and compare its sliding motion with "
"two fixed material references."
msgstr "改变斜面上方块的摩擦参数，将其滑动过程与两个参数固定的参考方块对比。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:54
msgid "Joint PD tuning"
msgstr "关节 PD 调参"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:60
msgid ""
"Tune a suspended three-joint arm with step and sine commands. Compare target"
" and measured angles on the live tracking plot."
msgstr "用阶跃和正弦指令调试悬挂的三关节机械臂，在实时跟踪曲线中对比目标角度和实测角度。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:63
msgid "MPM material response"
msgstr "MPM 材料响应"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:69
msgid ""
"Drop 1,728 particles onto a cylinder inside a catch tub. Try sand, snow, "
"clay, and water references, or tune individual parameters."
msgstr "将 1,728 个粒子落到承接容器内的圆柱上。可以尝试沙、雪、黏土和水的参考设置，也可以单独调整参数。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:72
msgid ""
"For the corresponding native settings, see :ref:`newton-using-vbd`, "
":ref:`mjwarp-solver-tuning`, :ref:`newton-tuning-mpm`, and :ref:`overview-"
"actuators`. The MPM presets are qualitative references on a coarse grid, "
"rather than calibrated materials. Material changes apply on reset with fresh"
" plastic history."
msgstr ""
"对应的原生配置见 :ref:`newton-using-vbd`、:ref:`mjwarp-solver-tuning`、:ref:`newton-"
"tuning-mpm` 和 :ref:`overview-actuators` 。MPM "
"预设是粗网格上的定性参考，并非经过标定的材料。修改材料后，需要重置才能生效，同时会重新初始化塑性历史状态。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:78
msgid "Policy control"
msgstr "策略控制"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:83
msgid "Cartpole balancing"
msgstr "Cartpole 平衡"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:89
msgid ""
"Push a pretrained balancing policy with up to 300 N in either direction. "
"Release the slider to watch it recover."
msgstr "对预训练的平衡策略施加任一方向、最大 300 N 的推力。松开滑块，观察它恢复平衡。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:92
msgid "G1 velocity control"
msgstr "G1 速度控制"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:98
msgid ""
"Command forward, sideways, and turning motion with travel and yaw pads using"
" the published WBC-AGILE policy."
msgstr "使用已发布的 WBC-AGILE 策略，通过平移和转向控制区指挥机器人前进、侧移和转弯。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:101
msgid "ANYmal-D velocity control"
msgstr "ANYmal-D 速度控制"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:107
msgid ""
"Drive an ANYmal-D with travel and yaw pads using a published Isaac Lab "
"Newton checkpoint."
msgstr "使用已发布的 Isaac Lab Newton 检查点，通过平移和转向控制区操纵 ANYmal-D。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:110
msgid "MicroDuck walking"
msgstr "MicroDuck 行走"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:116
msgid ""
"Hold the viewport joysticks to walk through a miniature courtyard. Drag the "
"robot to apply a 2 N push; release to let the policy recover."
msgstr "按住视口中的摇杆，在微型庭院中行走。拖动机器人可施加 2 N 的推力，松开后让策略恢复平衡。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:119
msgid ""
"Cartpole uses the published ``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct`` Newton policy. G1 uses"
" the external 29-joint WBC-AGILE ``Velocity-G1-v0`` policy. ANYmal-D uses "
"the ``Isaac-Velocity-Flat-AnymalD`` RSL-RL checkpoint with a tuned PD drive "
"in place of the native task's LSTM actuator. Its motion can differ from a "
"full task run. MicroDuck uses Pollen Robotics' published v5 ``velstand`` "
"policy and native BAM servos from `task PR #8270 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/pull/8270>`_. Its courtyard is decorative scenery over flat "
"ground; playback uses one captured reset with selected observation "
"randomization disabled. See :ref:`reinforcement-learning` for native "
"playback and training."
msgstr ""
"Cartpole 使用已发布的 ``Isaac-Cartpole-Direct`` Newton 策略。G1 使用外部的 29 关节 WBC-AGILE"
" ``Velocity-G1-v0`` 策略。ANYmal-D 使用 ``Isaac-Velocity-Flat-AnymalD`` 的 RSL-RL "
"检查点，并用调好参数的 PD 驱动替代原生任务中的 LSTM 执行器，因此运动表现可能与完整任务不同。MicroDuck 使用 Pollen "
"Robotics 发布的 v5 ``velstand`` 策略，以及 `任务 PR #8270 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/pull/8270>`_ 中的原生 BAM "
"舵机。庭院只是平地上的装饰场景；回放使用一次捕获的重置状态，并关闭了部分观测随机化。原生策略回放和训练见 :ref:`reinforcement-"
"learning` 。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:130
msgid "Manipulation"
msgstr "操作任务"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:135
msgid "Franka reach"
msgstr "Franka 目标到达"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:141
msgid ""
"Move the target position and watch a pretrained joint-position policy reach "
"for it."
msgstr "移动目标位置，观察预训练的关节位置策略如何让末端到达目标。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:144
msgid "Franka lift"
msgstr "Franka 物体抬升"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:150
msgid ""
"Watch a pretrained policy lift a cube from a pregrasp reset. Adjust its "
"target position, pause, or replay the episode."
msgstr "从预抓取的重置状态开始，观察预训练策略抬起立方体。可以调整目标位置、暂停或重放回合。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:153
msgid "Franka drawer opening"
msgstr "Franka 打开抽屉"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:159
msgid ""
"Play, pause, and reset a pretrained drawer-opening policy. Orbit the camera "
"to inspect the grasp and drawer motion."
msgstr "播放、暂停或重置预训练的开抽屉策略，环绕移动相机，观察抓取和抽屉运动。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:162
msgid ""
"These three demos use published Newton RSL-RL checkpoints for ``Isaac-Reach-"
"Franka`` (``joint_pos``), ``Isaac-Lift-Franka`` (``cube``), and ``Isaac-"
"Open-Drawer-Franka``. Playback repeats one captured reset every eight "
"seconds; Python episode and reset managers are not exported. Browse their "
"full task options in :ref:`environment-browser`."
msgstr ""
"这三个演示使用已发布的 Newton RSL-RL 检查点，分别对应 ``Isaac-Reach-Franka`` "
"（``joint_pos``）、``Isaac-Lift-Franka`` （``cube``）和 ``Isaac-Open-Drawer-"
"Franka``。回放每八秒重复一次捕获的重置状态；Python 中的回合管理器和重置管理器未被导出。完整的任务选项见 "
":ref:`environment-browser` 。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:169
msgid "About these demos"
msgstr "关于这些演示"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:171
msgid ""
"The demos are published alongside Isaac Lab documentation on GitHub Pages. "
"The site serves versioned simulation bundles, policies, geometry, and third-"
"party license notices. Newton's captured Warp kernels advance the physics, "
"Three.js displays the state, and a shared JavaScript evaluator runs the "
"policy networks in the browser. The documentation gallery contains small "
"thumbnails and links to these pages."
msgstr ""
"这些演示在 GitHub Pages 上随 Isaac Lab 文档一同发布。网站提供带版本的仿真包、策略、几何数据和第三方许可声明。捕获的 "
"Newton Warp 内核推进物理仿真，Three.js 显示状态，共用的 JavaScript "
"求值器在浏览器中运行策略网络。文档中的演示库提供小尺寸缩略图和对应页面链接。"

#: source/setup/interactive_demos.rst:177
msgid ""
"The exporters and demo application are maintained separately from Isaac Lab."
" The docs deployment downloads a versioned archive from Isaac Lab GitHub "
"releases and verifies its checksum before publishing; compiled assets are "
"kept outside the source tree. The public `reference PR #7974 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/pull/7974>`_ records the exporters, "
"shared viewer, and scene adaptations. Rebuilding requires the pinned "
"internal Newton Web compiler and Emscripten. The locomotion demos use the "
"version 3 viewer with controls inside the viewport. Other demos retain "
"version 1 links. Each archive preserves earlier version directories."
msgstr ""
"导出工具和演示应用独立于 Isaac Lab 维护。文档部署时，从 Isaac Lab GitHub releases "
"下载带版本的归档，并在发布前校验；编译产物不放入源码树。公开的 `参考 PR #7974 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/pull/7974>`_ 记录了导出工具、共用查看器和场景适配。重新构建需要固定版本的内部 Newton Web 编译器和 "
"Emscripten。行走演示使用第 3 版查看器，控制区位于视口内；其他演示保留第 1 版链接。每个归档都会保留旧版本目录。"
